{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["כי הרס תהרסם — On my own initiative I corrected the vocalization to תְּהָרְסֵם, the fortified pattern, for I had erred in my youth and followed the French manuscripts, which point it תַּהַרְסֵם, the weak pattern, like הרג תַּהַרְגֶּנּוּ. But since הרס is the fortified pattern, it should be likewise the fortified pattern תְּהָרְסֵם, like שַׁבֵּר תְּשַׁבֵּר. And subsequently I found in all the manuscripts of Spain and Ashkenaz the fortified pattern, as I had corrected it."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {0 "Rashbam reports his own youthful error and its correction. 'Fortified pattern' (משקל דגש) refers to the doubled middle radical; 'weak pattern' (משקל רפי) to the undoubled form."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:53.032998546Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}